{
  "$comment": [
    "Pocket Realm desktop (Windows) shared-source manifest.",
    "Single source of truth for which files from the Android app tree the",
    "desktop Gradle build compiles. The desktop build.gradle.kts consumes the",
    "'shared' list verbatim (fileTree include patterns);",
    "tests/test_desktop_shared_manifest.py pins that every listed file is",
    "android-free (no android.*/androidx.* imports or fully-qualified",
    "references, no Android-only libraries such as me.zhanghai.libarchive).",
    "Adding a file here REQUIRES that test to stay green; files needing a",
    "desktop twin (same package+name implemented against the JVM) are simply",
    "NOT listed here and live in desktop/src/main/kotlin instead."
  ],
  "android_tree_root": "android/app/src/main/java/com/pocketrealm",
